        <title xml:id="name85-1" xml:lang="en" srophe:tags="#syriaca-headword" resp="http://syriaca.org">2 Thessalonians (Peshitta version)</title>
        <title xml:id="name85-2" xml:lang="syr" srophe:tags="#syriaca-headword" source="#bib85-1">ܐܓܪܬܐ ܕܦܘܠܘܣ ܕܠܘܬ ܬܣܠ̈ܘܢܝܩܝܐ ܕܬܪܬܝܢ</title>
